[E-REFL] Error: `rfl` can't prove this
    ╭─[ reject/refl-stuck-inside-if.sw:19:50 ]
    │
 19 │ theorem selfPlayDraws (m: Move): play m m = 0 := rfl
    │                                                  ─┬─  
    │                                                   ╰─── `play m m` and `0` aren't equal
    │ 
    │ Note 1: computing the left side gives `if beats m m then 1 else if beats m m then 2 else 0`
    │ 
    │ Note 2: the left side is stuck on `m`: it can't compute further until `m` is known; a `match` on `m` (or `cases m`) splits it
    │ 
    │ Note 3: `rfl` proves `a = b` only when both sides compute to the same value
